--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eccf678c5f75db844a2f930a8b1c1e51, type: 3}
  m_Name: BookOpenDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Lines:
  - SpeakerName: Walter Fenric
    dialogueType: 1
    Text: You're holding this book... just like I once did. If you're here, I already
      know what you're going through.
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: -755799945, guid: 5db8a35a11721994882fa8846b0a9aac, type: 3}
    IsLeftSide: 1
  - SpeakerName: Walter Fenric
    dialogueType: 1
    Text: I spent years in these walls, trying to figure a way out. I failed, maybe
      too many times... but I learned things.
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: -755799945, guid: 5db8a35a11721994882fa8846b0a9aac, type: 3}
    IsLeftSide: 1
  - SpeakerName: OldPrisoner
    dialogueType: 1
    Text: "I left behind my steps, hidden across these pages. Start at the end \u2014
      there's a code I used to unlock my cell. It worked once\u2026 maybe it will
      again."
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1647885be446a51448241ecd6036b66d, type: 3}
    IsLeftSide: 1
